Subject: [PATCH] odhcpd: retain PD retirement and derive live RA MTU

Keep a withdrawn, previously bound PD identity until its original expiry,
without reserving allocation space or exporting/installing its old routes.
Renew/Rebind revoke the client's old hints; tentative offers and failed
allocations cannot destroy that authority. A committed replacement or
Release supersedes it. Retirement is in-memory and does not reconstruct
prefixes a client omits from its IA. Correct the authenticated Reconfigure
option length so clients can receive the withdrawal promptly.

Preserve configured RA MTU as policy and derive the effective value from
the current IPv6 interface MTU for every server/relay advertisement. Pure
MTU notifications schedule RA without restarting DHCP sockets.

